{"strongs": "H4586", "word": "מְעוּנִים", "translit": "me.u.ni", "root": "מעה", "morph": "N:N--LG", "pos": "proper name, of a people", "gloss": "Me`unim, Me`unites", "definition": "מְעוּנִים proper name, of a people Me`unim, Me`unites (usually connected with מָעוֺן , (see עון ), but dubious, compare Buhl Edom. 41 f. ); — a people South (SE ?) of Canaan (compare Buhl l.c .); — ׳ הַמּ 2Chr 26:7 and 1Chr 4:41 Qr ( Kt המעינים , ᵐ5 B τοὺς Μιναίους , ᵐ5 L τ. Κιναίους ; read also מֵהַמְּעוּנִים 2Chr 20:1 (for ᵑ0 מֵהָעַמּוֺנִים ), so ᵐ5 B A ( ᵐ5 L Αμμανιειμ ), Ew Be Ke Ot Kau Kit ; בְּנֵימְֿעוּנִים (among Nethinim who went back with Zerubbabel) Ezra 2:50 = Neh 7:52 are perhaps descendants of those named above ( 2Chr 26:7 ). ᵐ5 οἱ Μιναῖοι , but against ׳ מ = Mineans ( Glaser Skizze ii. 450 f. and others) see Sprenger ZMG xliv (1890), 505 . [ מָעוּף ] see עיף . מָעוֺר see עור .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4754')\">BDB4754</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4586')\">H4586</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4753')\">BDB4753</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4755')\">BDB4755</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מְעוּנִים</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a people</b> <highlightword>Me`unim, Me`unites</highlightword> (usually connected with <bdbheb>מָעוֺן</bdbheb>, (see  <bdbheb><reflink>עון</reflink></bdbheb>), but dubious, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Edom. 41 f.</sup></lookup>); — a people South (SE ?) of Canaan (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>l.c</sup></lookup>.); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַמּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,7)\">2Chr 26:7</ref> and <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:41\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,41)\">1Chr 4:41</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>המעינים</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('B')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>B</sup></reflink></lookup> <grk>τοὺς Μιναίους</grk>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>τ.</grk> <grk>Κιναίους</grk>; read also <bdbheb>מֵהַמְּעוּנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:1\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,1)\">2Chr 20:1</ref> (for <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>מֵהָעַמּוֺנִים</bdbheb>), so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('B')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>B</sup></reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('A')\"><reflink><sup>A</sup></reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><sup><reflink>L</reflink></sup></lookup> <grk>Αμμανιειμ</grk>), <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">Be</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ke')\">Ke</lookup> Ot <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kau')\">Kau</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kit')\">Kit</lookup>; <bdbheb>בְּנֵימְֿעוּנִים</bdbheb> (among Nethinim who went back with Zerubbabel) <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:50\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"50\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"50\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,50)\">Ezra 2:50</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:52\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"52\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"52\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,52)\">Neh 7:52</ref> are perhaps descendants of those named above (<ref ref=\"2Chr 26:7\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,7)\">2Chr 26:7</ref>). <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>οἱ Μιναῖοι</grk>, but against <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> = Mineans (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gl')\">Glaser<sup>Skizze ii. 450 f.</sup></lookup> and others) see Sprenger<sup>ZMG xliv (1890), 505</sup>. </p><hr><p>[<bdbheb>מָעוּף</bdbheb>] see  <bdbheb><reflink>עיף</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>מָעוֺר</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>עור</reflink></bdbheb>.</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Chr 26:7", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 26, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 4:41", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 4, "verse": 41}, {"raw": "2Chr 20:1", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 20, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ezra 2:50", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 2, "verse": 50}, {"raw": "Neh 7:52", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 52}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מְעוּנִים", "מָעוֺן", "עון", "׳", "הַמּ", "המעינים", "ᵐ5", "מֵהַמְּעוּנִים", "ᵑ0", "מֵהָעַמּוֺנִים", "בְּנֵימְֿעוּנִים", "מ", "מָעוּף", "עיף", "מָעוֺר", "עור"], "aramaic": [], "greek": ["τοὺς Μιναίους", "τ.", "Κιναίους", "Αμμανιειμ", "οἱ Μιναῖοι"], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["A", "B", "Be", "Buhl", "Ew", "Gl", "Kau", "Ke", "Kit", "Kt", "MT", "Qr", "Sept"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB4754", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}